# Enforce LF line endings for all text files, matching .editorconfig's
# `end_of_line = lf` (adopted from BenjaminMichaelis/DotnetTemplates).
# Without this, a machine with core.autocrlf=true silently re-introduces
# CRLF on every checkout, which makes the strict-format verification hook
# (scripts/hooks/verify-build.ps1 -> Invoke-DotNetFormatStrict.ps1) flag
# every existing file as a false positive instead of only new violations.
* text=auto eol=lf
